l raise (100) maintains aggression, builds the pot, and puts pressure on marginal hands while remaining low-risk. It’s a balanced play between value and bluff equity. Larger raises could be better, but 100 is the minimal way to take control and is within strategic range given stack sizes and game stage.\n\nAnswer: 100"}
